&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot; margin-top:18px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;eax-test-fixture-interface&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:xx-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:xx-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;AX Test Fixture Interface&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;This is a Python version of the EAX Test Fixture Interface. It is a GUI built on the Qt framework that allows the user to control the EAX Test Fixture. It is designed to be used with the telemetrix Arduino library. See the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#test-fixture-firmware&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;&quot;&gt;firmware&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; section for more information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
