&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Run Test&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Open About&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;installation&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;nstallation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;Install Python &amp;gt;= 3.7.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;The programming software called &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New';&quot;&gt;up.exe&lt;/span&gt; provided for by the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asix.net/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;&quot;&gt;Asix corporation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is required for programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;Install the required Python package dependencies listed in &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New';&quot;&gt;requirements.txt&lt;/span&gt; using the command &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New';&quot;&gt;pip install -r requirements.txt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;A standalone executable can be created using &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New';&quot;&gt;pyinstaller&lt;/span&gt;. Install &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New';&quot;&gt;pyinstaller&lt;/span&gt; using the command &lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New';&quot;&gt;pip install pyinstaller&lt;/span&gt;. (Optional)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;test-fixture-firmware&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;est Fixture Firmware&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;This application uses the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;Telemetrix4Arduino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; Arduino library to communicate with the test fixture. It can be compilled and uploaded via the Arduino IDE or the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;arduino-cli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; tool. The installation of the firmware can be automated using the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Scripts/Install.ps1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;&quot;&gt;Install.ps1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; script. This script will download the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;arduino-cli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; tool, install the required libraries, compile the firmware, and upload it to the Arduino. It prompts for the COM port of the Arduino before uploading the firmware. Modify the file &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/dhahaj/EAX-Python-Interface/blob/main/sketches/Telemetrix4Arduino/Telemetrix4Arduino.ino&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;&quot;&gt;Telemetrix4Arduino.ino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; to make modifications to the firmware, such as changing the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;arduino_instance_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;. See &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mryslab.github.io/telemetrix/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; text-decoration: underline; color:#7cfbfc;&quot;&gt;The Telemetrix Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; for more information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;configuration-file&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;onfiguration File&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;config.yaml&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt; file contains the configuration for the application. The table below describes the configuration options.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;app_name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;The name of the application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;app_version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;The version of the application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;firmware&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;The EAX firmware configuration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;testing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;The testing configuration. (Not currently implemented)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;settings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system','BlinkMacSystemFont','Segoe WPC','Segoe UI','system-ui','Ubuntu','Droid Sans','sans-serif'; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;The default settings configuration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
